1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:19.260
The clouds floating in the cobalt blue,

3
00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:29.170
got lost and will soak us all tomorrow.

4
00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:39.030
It'll be fine if you just smile before the sunset.

5
00:00:39.030 --> 00:00:43.410
If it's your wish, you can just

6
00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:45.870
say a spell in your chest.

7
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:49.270
For your hopes...

8
00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:56.510
Our quick premonition

9
00:00:56.510 --> 00:00:59.390
is showing in the rainbow colored music notes.

10
00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:04.770
Won't you come with me?

11
00:01:04.770 --> 00:01:06.640
We're fallen angels,

12
00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:09.360
we'll fire arrows into your dreams.

13
00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:44.520
What color shall we add

14
00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:47.390
into the cobalt blue?

15
00:01:52.820 --> 00:01:57.490
Destroy the sad reality that reflects in your eyes.

16
00:01:57.820 --> 00:02:02.780
Let's raise our wings, full of warmth.

17
00:02:02.780 --> 00:02:04.700
Surreal fallen angels,

18
00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:07.560
singing from our hearts.

19
00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:38.270
<b>The Circling Bounties and
The Duel on Banaro Island!</b>

20
00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:41.640
Speaking of the judiciary island Enies Lobby,

21
00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:44.640
After causing a disturbance on the entranceway of the World Government,

22
00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:48.600
Both the marines and pirates won't be able to remain silent.

23
00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:53.150
Right now, the strawhat pirates' name is resounding in the whole world.

24
00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:55.130
Along with this poster.

25
00:02:57.510 --> 00:02:59.250
Sanji is the best!

26
00:03:00.420 --> 00:03:04.240
<b>East Blue</b>
<b>Floating Restaurant Baratie</b>

27
00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:02.840
Isn't it amazing, customers?!

28
00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:04.240
It's just like the real thing!

29
00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:09.070
This is the home of the 77 million belly bounty Black Leg Sanji!

30
00:03:09.070 --> 00:03:13.240
Welcome to the Floating Restaurant Baratie!

31
00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:17.160
<b>Foosha Village Luffy's hometown</b>

32
00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:17.160
<b>East Blue</b>

33
00:03:14.680 --> 00:03:16.360
Party!

34
00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:18.000
Today we party!

35
00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:20.240
For the most expensive guy in the east!

36
00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:22.020
300 million bounty!

37
00:03:22.020 --> 00:03:25.380
A toast for our Luffy!

38
00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:31.730
Be silent!

39
00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:33.610
Show some manners! Manners!

40
00:03:33.610 --> 00:03:35.200
Cheers!

41
00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:36.520
Hey!

42
00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:38.350
Geez...

43
00:03:39.020 --> 00:03:41.940
No one listens to what the mayor says.

44
00:03:43.150 --> 00:03:44.590
Seems like he's having fun.

45
00:03:44.590 --> 00:03:47.340
He's even got this cute pet.

46
00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:49.280
These must be Luffy's friends.

47
00:03:49.520 --> 00:03:52.230
You call these criminals friends?!

48
00:03:55.180 --> 00:03:59.130
An enemy to the whole world came from our village!

49
00:03:59.990 --> 00:04:03.680
I've never heard of a pirate declaring war on the World Government!

50
00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:04.500
That's true...

51
00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:07.700
What does that Garp think he's doing?!

52
00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:10.650
Letting his own grandson cause such a terrible incident.

53
00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:12.870
What's wrong with those three guys...

54
00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:14.720
I wonder if Dadan knows about this...

55
00:04:15.090 --> 00:04:16.580
Cheers!

56
00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:18.180
I told you to be quiet!

57
00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:22.140
<b>East Blue</b>
<b>Syrup Village Usopp's hometown</b>

58
00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:24.960
Sogeking, the King of the Snipers...

59
00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:25.940
You're right!

60
00:04:25.940 --> 00:04:27.130
There's no doubt about it!

61
00:04:27.130 --> 00:04:28.370
This is Usopp-san!

62
00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:29.000
Right?!

63
00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:31.110
This nose is the Captain's, right?!

64
00:04:31.990 --> 00:04:34.200
The villagers don't believe us!

65
00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:36.020
He's worth 30 million!

66
00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:38.250
But we knew Kaya-san would recognize him!

67
00:04:38.510 --> 00:04:40.830
Nobody knows the awesomeness of the Captain!

68
00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:44.450
Captain is a man who turns all lies into truth!

69
00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:47.740
This mask is so cool!

70
00:04:47.740 --> 00:04:49.160
Let's make some clay replicas!

71
00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:51.970
Where are you going Kaya-san?

72
00:04:53.570 --> 00:04:56.210
I'm gonna continue my medical studies.

73
00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:58.330
I have to become one fine doctor!

74
00:04:58.330 --> 00:05:02.560
So even if Usopp-san comes back injured, I can cure all of his wounds!

75
00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:07.740
I'm jealous of the Captain...

76
00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:10.100
We'll kick his ass if he makes Kaya-san sad.

77
00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:15.860
<b>East Blue</b>
<b>Shimotsuki Village Zoro's Hometown</b>

78
00:05:11.850 --> 00:05:12.950
Sensei! Sensei!

79
00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:15.860
Is it true that the Pirate Hunter Zoro once studied at this dojo?!

80
00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:18.000
Yes, it's true.

81
00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:20.840
But I forbid you to look up to him!

82
00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:23.880
Why?! He's so cool!

83
00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:26.270
Please show us how to be pirates too!

84
00:05:26.270 --> 00:05:28.250
I didn't teach him how to become a pirate.

85
00:05:28.520 --> 00:05:29.430
Really?!

86
00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:31.090
Don't lie, sensei!

87
00:05:31.090 --> 00:05:34.010
I also wanna become such an amazing swordsman!
My, my, what a terrible elder they have chosen.

88
00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:36.990
I was surprised about the events on Judiciary Island, but...

89
00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:34.840
Me too!

90
00:05:36.990 --> 00:05:40.490
Zoro-kun, it seems you have no regrets.

91
00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:42.280
No matter what kind of person you become,

92
00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:45.560
It's fine a long as you treasure your way of the sword.

93
00:05:45.560 --> 00:05:50.020
<b>East Blue</b>
<b>Cocoyashi Village Nami's Hometown</b>

94
00:05:48.350 --> 00:05:50.020
Gen-san!

95
00:05:50.020 --> 00:05:51.480
Here are the oranges.

96
00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:53.990
What, you brought them again, Nojiko?!

97
00:05:53.990 --> 00:05:55.640
Even though I told you I'll buy them in the store.

98
00:05:55.640 --> 00:05:58.700
Well, just accept them, don't be so modest.

99
00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:01.710
You know that you're like a father to Nami and I.

100
00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:03.970
If you say so.

101
00:06:03.970 --> 00:06:05.020
What're you doing?

102
00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:06.610
Well...

103
00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:10.410
I'm trying to use the Den Den Mushi to call the Marine headquarters to complain

104
00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:12.100
But I'm not getting a single response!

105
00:06:13.490 --> 00:06:14.480
Complain?

106
00:06:14.480 --> 00:06:15.270
That's right!

107
00:06:16.010 --> 00:06:20.260
Do they really think they can distribute this improper poster to the entire world?!

108
00:06:20.260 --> 00:06:24.020
Instead of bounty hunters, lovestruck suitors will gather to go after her! Unacceptable!

109
00:06:24.020 --> 00:06:26.360
But you liked that picture, right?

110
00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:28.240
Since you enlarged it.

111
00:06:29.420 --> 00:06:31.270
Well, it's fine, besides...

112
00:06:31.270 --> 00:06:33.070
They're keeping the promise they made to you...

113
00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:37.990
If by any chance you take away Nami's smile,

114
00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:39.980
I'll personally go and kill you!

115
00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:43.060
That's the evidence.

116
00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:44.740
Well, that's true but...

117
00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:47.200
That's the pirates problem!

118
00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:49.100
Then, would you prefer an ugly photo?

119
00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:51.710
No! That's unacceptable!

120
00:06:51.710 --> 00:06:56.670
<b>The Grand Line</b>
<b>Sakura Kingdom Chopper's Hometown</b>

121
00:07:07.370 --> 00:07:08.600
Doctor Kureha.

122
00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:11.810
Dolton, why did you call me?

123
00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:13.780
I'm a very busy person!

124
00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:15.580
I'm very sorry.

125
00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:17.380
I just had to show you this.

126
00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:19.830
What do you want? The secret to my youth?

127
00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:24.730
Anyway Dolton, why don't you go live in the castle as king?

128
00:07:24.730 --> 00:07:26.000
I can lend you a room.

129
00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:29.680
No, thank you, I'm already used to living in this village.

130
00:07:29.680 --> 00:07:31.760
Besides, I like eating chestnuts.

131
00:07:34.440 --> 00:07:37.470
It's the Straw Hat kid and the others...

132
00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:40.720
Wanted posters came out after the recent incident.

133
00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:43.890
Chopper.

134
00:07:43.890 --> 00:07:46.270
I think they made a mistake about the amount.

135
00:07:47.530 --> 00:07:50.390
It's fine since I got to see his face.

136
00:07:50.680 --> 00:07:52.050
That's right...

137
00:07:52.050 --> 00:07:54.590
This is the best news I've gotten in a while.

138
00:07:56.420 --> 00:08:02.330
<b>The Grand Line</b>
<b>White soil Island Baltigo.</b>

139
00:07:58.220 --> 00:08:02.330
The rebel army has succeded at the South Blue St. Urea!

140
00:08:02.770 --> 00:08:04.710
One more kingdom has fallen...

141
00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:06.140
They did it!

142
00:08:06.140 --> 00:08:07.730
With this, the other day news about North Blue...

143
00:08:07.730 --> 00:08:09.530
Don't be glad about a victory!

144
00:08:09.530 --> 00:08:10.650
This is war.

145
00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:12.890
I-I'm sorry...

146
00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:15.820
And this is?

147
00:08:17.270 --> 00:08:18.470
It's Straw Hat Luffy.

148
00:08:19.190 --> 00:08:22.700
The one who took down Crocodile at Arabasta.

149
00:08:22.700 --> 00:08:28.020
After the events at Enies Lobby, the government couldn't keep hiding his big group of pirates.

150
00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:33.980
The crew's total bounty is 667 million and 50 belly.

151
00:08:33.980 --> 00:08:36.820
Their Captain is the marine Garp's...

152
00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:38.560
Where are you going?

153
00:08:38.560 --> 00:08:40.830
To get some fresh air.

154
00:08:44.410 --> 00:08:47.950
Live according to your thoughts, Luffy.

155
00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:52.600
There are times when the era suddenly determines everything...

156
00:08:54.860 --> 00:09:04.290
<b>The World's Most Wanted Man</b>
<b>The Revolutionary Dragon</b>
<b>Monkey D. Dragon</b>

157
00:08:55.530 --> 00:08:58.110
Question the world!

158
00:08:58.110 --> 00:09:01.720
The day we meet will come.

159
00:09:04.290 --> 00:09:06.900
Oh! Ace!

160
00:09:12.340 --> 00:09:19.620
We go back three days before the bounties of the Strawhat crew surprised the whole world.

161
00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:24.100
An event occurred on a certain island...

162
00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:27.580
This is the Grand Line, Banaro Island.

163
00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:28.880
Commander.

164
00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:35.210
Knock it off! Commander is a word only those respectful of that person are allowed to say.

165
00:09:35.210 --> 00:09:36.750
Stop mocking.

166
00:09:37.730 --> 00:09:39.880
So you're the famous Fire Fist Ace...

167
00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:40.730
Yeah, that's right.

168
00:09:40.730 --> 00:09:41.810
Nice to meet you.

169
00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:45.730
It seems now you've become quite a Captain, right?

170
00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:49.890
Captain of the Blackbeard pirates, Marshall D. Teach.

171
00:09:51.990 --> 00:09:53.770
What's wrong, Ace?!

172
00:09:53.770 --> 00:09:55.390
It's been a long time!

173
00:09:55.390 --> 00:09:57.410
How did you know I was here?

174
00:09:57.410 --> 00:10:00.300
Teach, stop asking useless questions.

175
00:10:00.300 --> 00:10:02.770
You took a man's life.

176
00:10:02.770 --> 00:10:06.080
You must have a comprehension of the current situation.

177
00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:07.760
Isn't that right?

178
00:10:07.760 --> 00:10:09.500
Yeah, I know.

179
00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:12.100
Then, let me say just one thing.

180
00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:15.880
Ace, will you join my crew?!

181
00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:18.370
Rule the world with me!

182
00:10:18.370 --> 00:10:21.090
I've already planned every single thing.

183
00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:24.120
Whitebeard's time is over already.

184
00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:26.060
It is I who'll become the Pirate King!

185
00:10:26.470 --> 00:10:33.490
First, I'll go to Water Seven from here to kill Straw Hat Luffy and hand him over to the government.

186
00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:35.730
Luffy...?!

187
00:10:35.730 --> 00:10:36.650
What did you say...?

188
00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:39.060
Oh, You know him?

189
00:10:39.060 --> 00:10:41.660
I won't let you lay a finger on him.

190
00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:43.240
He's my little brother!

191
00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:48.500
And, of course I'm not gonna join....

192
00:10:50.060 --> 00:10:51.000
...your crew.

193
00:10:52.900 --> 00:10:55.300
Seems like we have a guy without manners here.

194
00:10:55.610 --> 00:10:56.410
Fire Gun!

195
00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:03.140
Flame Commandment...

196
00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:05.280
Fire Pillar!

197
00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:14.190
Auger, Burgess.

198
00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:16.280
You stay out of this!

199
00:11:16.280 --> 00:11:18.500
You're still no match for that man!

200
00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:19.580
Step back!

201
00:11:19.580 --> 00:11:20.280
Sorry.

202
00:11:20.420 --> 00:11:21.400
Fire Fist!

203
00:11:27.430 --> 00:11:28.700
Captain!

204
00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:30.460
Captain!

205
00:11:36.570 --> 00:11:37.160
Captain.

206
00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:43.620
Lay it off, you guys!

207
00:11:43.620 --> 00:11:44.740
Stay back!

208
00:11:51.240 --> 00:11:53.930
I understand, Ace.

209
00:11:53.930 --> 00:11:56.150
You want to kill me, right?

210
00:11:56.150 --> 00:11:59.940
That's right, the murder of a crewmate is a big crime.

211
00:12:00.310 --> 00:12:04.320
It's true I killed the 4th Division Commander Thatch!

212
00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:06.480
I had no choice!

213
00:12:06.480 --> 00:12:09.750
He had the devil fruit I wanted.

214
00:12:10.380 --> 00:12:14.540
The ship's rule was that the guy who finds it gets to eat it.

215
00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:18.130
I memorized all devil fruit shapes from a book, so...

216
00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:22.130
I immediately knew that was the one I was looking for.

217
00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:30.100
I stayed all those decades on Whitebeard’s ship thinking it would raise the chance to run into that fruit.

218
00:12:31.490 --> 00:12:34.100
If I had run out of luck, I'd have given up on it, but...

219
00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:37.440
That fruit came into my friend's possession!

220
00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:44.150
And after killing Thatch... you stole it.

221
00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:46.150
Well, it was just the spur of the moment.

222
00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:51.430
This ability has chosen me, Ace!

223
00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:57.170
With this, I have become the strongest man, Ace!

224
00:12:58.050 --> 00:12:58.930
Look!

225
00:12:58.930 --> 00:13:01.700
It's unique even among logia!

226
00:13:06.350 --> 00:13:09.410
Ace, your body is fire, right?

227
00:13:16.170 --> 00:13:17.940
I am...

228
00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:19.110
Darkness!

229
00:13:20.300 --> 00:13:23.430
Look! It's that black smoke from before!

230
00:13:23.430 --> 00:13:25.700
Those pirates are still in town!

231
00:13:25.960 --> 00:13:28.390
They're still up to something!

232
00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:30.610
At this rate, the town will be destroyed!

233
00:13:30.610 --> 00:13:31.860
Don't get near them!

234
00:13:31.860 --> 00:13:33.510
Just run!

235
00:13:40.490 --> 00:13:41.920
Darkness?

236
00:13:42.610 --> 00:13:45.370
That's right, Commander Ace.

237
00:13:45.370 --> 00:13:48.250
I can't get killed by you!

238
00:13:48.250 --> 00:13:52.590
Out of all the devil fruits recorded in history, the one with this power is known as the most evil of them all!

239
00:13:53.120 --> 00:13:56.120
A logia, the Darkness Fruit.

240
00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:59.050
I've become a man of darkness!

241
00:13:59.050 --> 00:14:03.320
I'll give you a taste of its power right now!

242
00:14:05.510 --> 00:14:06.980
Do as you like.

243
00:14:10.800 --> 00:14:12.360
What're you doing?! Hurry up!

244
00:14:12.360 --> 00:14:13.850
The Captain is rampaging!

245
00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:15.030
Hurry up and take cover!

246
00:14:15.030 --> 00:14:18.130
Even we might get involved!

247
00:14:18.130 --> 00:14:19.560
Stand up!

248
00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:37.440
Something is crawling on the ground.

249
00:14:37.440 --> 00:14:40.240
It's that thing that comes out of his body.

250
00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:41.360
So scary!

251
00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:44.030
It's like a black hole on the ground!

252
00:14:44.030 --> 00:14:45.860
Looks like we could get sucked in!

253
00:14:46.250 --> 00:14:47.500
Hurry up and escape!

254
00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:48.710
Find shelter!

255
00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:52.240
Take refuge in the forest!

256
00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:53.880
Run to the coast!

257
00:14:59.840 --> 00:15:01.870
Darkness is gravity.

258
00:15:01.870 --> 00:15:04.550
The power to drag in everything...

259
00:15:04.550 --> 00:15:06.640
and to keep all light from escaping,

260
00:15:06.640 --> 00:15:09.210
infinite gravity.

261
00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:15.140
Even so, it doesn't seem to be reaching me.

262
00:15:15.650 --> 00:15:18.270
I'm not going after you yet...

263
00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:21.790
Just stand there and take a look at the town.

264
00:15:23.620 --> 00:15:25.100
Black Hole!

265
00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:48.430
The town is... being swallowed into the ground!

266
00:15:48.430 --> 00:15:49.560
Why?!

267
00:15:49.560 --> 00:15:51.440
W-What's going on?!

268
00:15:57.320 --> 00:16:02.690
The gravity of darkness condenses every object with its infinite power.

269
00:16:02.690 --> 00:16:03.980
Crushing them!

270
00:16:18.100 --> 00:16:21.250
Am I dreaming?

271
00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:23.250
Our town has...

272
00:16:30.930 --> 00:16:33.050
Has it vanished?

273
00:16:33.050 --> 00:16:34.600
Right now I'll show you...

274
00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:38.400
What became of it!

275
00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:39.400
Liberation!

276
00:16:53.760 --> 00:16:54.720
The town has...

277
00:16:55.630 --> 00:16:57.260
Turned into just a pile of wood.

278
00:17:00.400 --> 00:17:02.240
You get it now, Ace?!

279
00:17:02.240 --> 00:17:05.040
This is the power I've gained!

280
00:17:07.410 --> 00:17:08.380
Firefly...

281
00:17:08.880 --> 00:17:09.950
Fiery Doll!

282
00:17:12.900 --> 00:17:14.810
Hot!

283
00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:21.700
I understand pretty well the greatness of the power of darkness.

284
00:17:21.700 --> 00:17:23.200
But, this is quite strange...

285
00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:27.350
If you're a logia, you should be able to dodge an attack such as this.

286
00:17:39.390 --> 00:17:41.140
I already told you...

287
00:17:41.140 --> 00:17:43.410
Darkness drags in everything.

288
00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:46.090
Bullets, blades, strikes, fire and even lightning.

289
00:17:46.880 --> 00:17:50.550
I can't dodge attacks like the rest of you do.

290
00:17:50.550 --> 00:17:54.920
My body absorbs much more pain than a normal human.

291
00:17:56.900 --> 00:18:02.970
But, in exchange for that risk there's one more thing I'm capable of absorbing!

292
00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:04.210
Dark Vortex!

293
00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:12.640
The gravity of darkness can accurately absorb the "entity" of a devil fruit user!

294
00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:18.580
Gravity?!

295
00:18:22.440 --> 00:18:24.090
And thus, my body can...!

296
00:18:28.630 --> 00:18:30.100
How is it?

297
00:18:30.100 --> 00:18:33.420
Have you figured it out yet, Ace?

298
00:18:35.110 --> 00:18:35.880
No way...!

299
00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:05.840
It's been a while since someone actually hit you, right?

300
00:19:05.840 --> 00:19:07.010
Ace.

301
00:19:07.800 --> 00:19:12.010
You understood the moment I grabbed you.

302
00:19:13.650 --> 00:19:17.090
The other thing my darkness can absorb is...

303
00:19:17.090 --> 00:19:18.760
Devil fruit powers!

304
00:19:20.160 --> 00:19:25.940
In other words, by being touched, those with devil fruit abilities are unable to use their ability!

305
00:19:27.040 --> 00:19:30.170
Logia, Zoan, Paramecia....

306
00:19:30.170 --> 00:19:34.690
All those overconfident devil fruit users in the world...

307
00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:37.610
I've obtained the ability to expose their weakness!

308
00:19:39.180 --> 00:19:40.700
So it's fine if I don't get caught.

309
00:19:41.190 --> 00:19:45.330
I just proved to you that you can't get away from the gravity of darkness!

310
00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:46.490
Dark Vortex!

311
00:19:51.010 --> 00:19:52.380
St. Elmo's Fire!

312
00:19:54.020 --> 00:19:54.800
Ace...!

313
00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:11.280
Damn!

314
00:20:11.280 --> 00:20:13.370
A flame lance?!

315
00:20:14.500 --> 00:20:16.460
He almost broke my neck!

316
00:20:18.430 --> 00:20:21.260
Quite a troublesome ability he has.

317
00:20:22.150 --> 00:20:23.180
Cross Fire!

318
00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:38.460
Another banana rock is being destroyed...

319
00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:42.010
What's going on?

320
00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:44.050
This isn't humane.

321
00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:49.680
Not only this town...

322
00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:51.150
The whole island will get...!

323
00:20:57.520 --> 00:21:03.210
I always thought that devil fruit users relied too much on their abilities,

324
00:21:03.210 --> 00:21:06.150
and if they happened to lose them, they would become rather fragile, but...

325
00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:10.820
As expected of a Commander on Whitebeard's ship...

326
00:21:10.820 --> 00:21:13.250
His basic combat abilities are also quite fearsome.

327
00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:15.750
Well then, today once again...

328
00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:18.670
Fate has separated our ways.

329
00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:28.610
Everything is useless before darkness.

330
00:21:28.610 --> 00:21:31.010
Even that strength of yours.

331
00:21:31.830 --> 00:21:35.220
However, it would be a shame to waste that power.

332
00:21:36.120 --> 00:21:39.160
Ace! Join my crew!

333
00:21:42.480 --> 00:21:47.010
If I surrender my power to you, then there was no point in me being a man.

334
00:21:48.090 --> 00:21:51.620
I definitely won't live with regrets.

335
00:21:51.620 --> 00:21:53.380
Got that, idiot?

336
00:21:54.960 --> 00:21:57.390
How long can you keep living like that in this world...

337
00:21:57.950 --> 00:22:00.790
It's a shame, Ace.

338
00:22:02.870 --> 00:22:04.750
Die by the darkness!

339
00:22:05.580 --> 00:22:07.370
Great Flame Commandment...!!

340
00:22:15.730 --> 00:22:17.310
Flame Emperor!!!

341
00:22:25.780 --> 00:22:27.800
The sun or the darkness.

342
00:22:27.800 --> 00:22:29.280
There can only be one winner!

343
00:22:30.340 --> 00:22:32.850
I'll make Whitebeard...

344
00:22:32.850 --> 00:22:34.290
The King.

345
00:22:52.110 --> 00:22:55.310
The Grand Line Banaro Island duel...

346
00:22:56.240 --> 00:22:58.880
The fight between those two pirates,

347
00:22:58.880 --> 00:23:06.600
Will be remembered as the trigger for a big event that has yet to come.

348
